      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=20>\n-  Each time a spin has one or more Wild symbols, a Wild multiplier
    is chosen.\n-  Multiplier is chosen randomly between 2x and 10x.\n-  The chosen
    multiplier is applied to the sum value of all Wild symbols in that spin.\n   The
    multiplier does not apply to the line wins."
